sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agente
  participant E as Engine
  participant C as Companion
  A->>E: tabs_list
  E->>C: list tabs
  C-->>E: ctab_A, ctab_B
  E-->>A: tabIds opacos
  A->>E: snapshot tabId=ctab_A
  E->>C: snapshot chromeId+docGen
  C-->>E: outline + @e1 @e2 docGen=7
  E-->>A: refs + documentToken
  Note over A: humano troca de aba visualmente
  A->>E: click tabId=ctab_A ref=@e1
  E->>C: resolve ctab_A, check docGen=7
  alt docGen ainda 7
    C-->>E: applied
  else navegado ou tab morta
    C-->>E: not_applied stale_*
  end
